<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pelangi year net 57.95 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pelangi year net 57.95 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, '97</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  57.95   vs	  53.86</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 18.0    vs	  16.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   203.47   vs	 202.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    71.76   vs	  75.91</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.78   vs  less   2.01</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	10.0    vs	   7.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Pelangi Bhd is mainly engaged in property development and investment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
